Subject: [PATCH 4/5] Add GPL compliance docs for CaveCAD distribution

README, readme.txt and LICENSE.txt now state CaveCAD is a GPLv3
modified version of QCAD 3.33 with public source on the cavecad
branch. NOTICE.md records the modification summary GPLv3 5(a) asks
for; PUBLISHING.md is the pre-release checklist (license files in
every package, source pushed and tagged first, no Pro/DWG bits,
distinct product name).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
